# Account Zone URL
# The URL of the separately deployed Account zone app (Next.js Zones).
# See: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/multi-zones
# In production, set this to the deployed URL of the Account zone app, e.g.:
#   ACCOUNT_ZONE_URL=https://account.acmsa.org
ACCOUNT_ZONE_URL=http://localhost:3001

